*.go text eol=lf

# There is no Git LFS rule any more. The vendored CLI binary
# (bin/grants-pp-cli-linux) was the only LFS-tracked file and, measured on
# 2026-09-20, about 86% of the repository. The image now builds the CLI from a
# pinned upstream commit (see the Dockerfile), so the binary and vendor-cli.sh
# were removed and no new copies are added. The old blobs and LFS objects stay
# in the history: removing those means rewriting history, which invalidates
# every existing clone and every commit hash the server and CI refer to. That
# is a separate decision.